              Sign In
            </span></span></div></span></span></div></div> <div tabindex="-1" class="el-drawer__wrapper" style="display:none;" data-v-3bb9afe7 data-v-118d177b><div role="document" tabindex="-1" class="el-drawer__container"><div aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="el-drawer__title" aria-label="" role="dialog" tabindex="-1" class="el-drawer ltr small-screen-nav-menu__drawer" style="width:30%;"><header id="el-drawer__title" class="el-drawer__header"><span role="heading" title=""></span><!----></header><!----></div></div></div> <!----></nav> <main main-content class="flex-1 flex-basis-auto relative" data-v-f507df84><div class="bg-[#f5f5f5] py-40" data-v-34e27da3 data-v-f507df84><main class="bg-white border-[1px] border-solid border-[#cacaca] w-1280 m-auto pt-[15px] pl-30 pr-45" data-v-34e27da3><h1 class="text-center mt-20 mb-10" data-v-34e27da3>Multilayer high precision PCB's with impedance control</h1> <div data-v-34e27da3><p class="mt-30 font-bold" data-v-34e27da3>JLCPCB can produce High-precision multilayer board with capabilities listed in below table.</p> <table class="table w-[650px] font-14 border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] ml-10 mt-10 rounded-[5px]" data-v-34e27da3><tr class="bg-[#F0F9FE]" data-v-34e27da3><th width="275px" class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8 text-left" data-v-34e27da3>
            Min. Trace width/Spacing
          </th> <th class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8 text-left" data-v-34e27da3>
            Min. Via
          </th> <th class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8 text-left" data-v-34e27da3>
            Min. BGA
          </th></tr> <tr data-v-34e27da3><td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>3.5mil</td> <td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>0.2mm</td> <td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>0.25mm</td></tr></table> <p class="m-10 text-[#888]" data-v-34e27da3>It is very convenient for customers to conduct an impedance matching design, according to JLCPCB’s laminated structure and related parameters. The PCB will be strictly produced in accordance with the following stackup.</p></div> <div data-v-34e27da3><p class="mt-30 font-bold" data-v-34e27da3>Controlled Impedance PCB Parameters and Stackup</p> <p class="m-10 text-[#888]" data-v-34e27da3>1.Prepreg dielectric constant:</p> <table class="table w-[650px] font-14 border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] ml-10 mt-10 rounded-[5px]" data-v-34e27da3><tr class="bg-[#F0F9FE]" data-v-34e27da3><th class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8 text-left" data-v-34e27da3>
            Prepreg type
          </th> <th class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8 text-left" data-v-34e27da3>
            Dielectric constant
          </th></tr> <tr data-v-34e27da3><td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>7628</td> <td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>4.4</td></tr> <tr data-v-34e27da3><td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>3313</td> <td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>4.1</td></tr> <tr data-v-34e27da3><td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>1080</td> <td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>3.91</td></tr> <tr data-v-34e27da3><td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>2116</td> <td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>4.16</td></tr></table> <p class="m-10 text-[#888]" data-v-34e27da3>2.Solder mask Parameters</p> <table class="table w-[935px] font-14 border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] ml-10 mt-10 rounded-[5px]" data-v-34e27da3><tr class="bg-[#F0F9FE]" data-v-34e27da3><th class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8 text-left" data-v-34e27da3>
            Coating Above Substrate C1
          </th> <th class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8 text-left" data-v-34e27da3>
            Coating Above Trace C2
          </th> <th class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8 text-left" data-v-34e27da3>
            Coating Between Traces C3
          </th> <th class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8 text-left" data-v-34e27da3>
            Coating Dielectric CEr
          </th></tr> <tr data-v-34e27da3><td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>1.2mil</td> <td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>0.6mil</td> <td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>1.2mil</td> <td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>3.8</td></tr></table> <p class="m-10 text-[#888]" data-v-34e27da3>3. Core dielectric constant</p> <table class="table w-[250px] font-14 border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] ml-10 mt-10 rounded-[5px]" data-v-34e27da3><tr class="bg-[#F0F9FE]" data-v-34e27da3><th class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8 text-left" data-v-34e27da3>
            Core dielectric constant
          </th></tr> <tr data-v-34e27da3><td class="border-[1px] border-solid border-[#ddd] p-8" data-v-34e27da3>4.6</td></tr></table> <p class="m-10 text-[#888]" data-v-34e27da3 data-v-34e27da3>For your convenience, we have designed an <a href="/pcb-impedance-calculator" target="_blank" class="no-underline hover:underline text-[#0072fc]" data-v-34e27da3>
          Impedance Calculator
        </a> to help you calculate the impedance and the trace width you require.</p></div> <p class="mt-30 font-bold" data-v-34e27da3>4-Layer Impedance Control Stackup</p> <div data-v-34e27da3><div class="inline-block mr-90" data-v-34e27da3><p class="m-10" data-v-34e27da3>Thickness</p> <button type="button" class="btn px-10 py-5 ml-10 border-[1px] border-solid border-[#cddbe4] mr-[15px]" data-v-34e27da3>
          0.8mm
        </button><button type="button" class="btn px-10 py-5 ml-10 border-[1px] border-solid border-[#cddbe4] mr-[15px]" data-v-34e27da3>
          1.0mm
        </button><button type="button" class="btn px-10 py-5 ml-10 border-[1px] border-solid border-[#cddbe4] mr-[15px]" data-v-34e27da3>
